cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite this software record and the model papers listed under references."
title: "COPSE V2.1 with a temperature-dependent marine silica cycle"
abstract: >-
  A modified version of COPSE V2.1 in which an explicit dissolved-silica
  reservoir, an alkalinity-DIC closure and a temperature-dependent
  reverse-weathering flux are added to the original carbon-oxygen-phosphorus-
  sulfur model.
